      "writtenOn": "2021-11-08T19:16:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think that div255() is the wrong abstraction. I think we want is\nU16 premul(c, a) {\n  U16 t \u003d c * a + 0x80\n  return (t + (t \u003e\u003e 8)) \u003e\u003e 8;\n}\n\n\nI think the real question is \"how often do we have to premul?\"",
      "parentUuid": "68fd7423_c0308c14",
